## unit 1: de bzhin gshegs pa ni 'dun pa s 'gro ba ma yin gyi de bzhin gshegs pa 'i 'dun pa ni ye shes sngon du 'gro ba nyid de de'i phyir de bzhin gshegs pa 'i 'dun pa nyams pa med ces bya 'o sems can thams cad la bla na med pa 'i 'dun pa yongs su rdzogs pa r bya ba 'i phyir chos kyang ston te 'di ni de bzhin gshegs pa 'i de bzhin gshegs pa 'i 'phrin las nyi shu rtsa gcig pa 'o de la 'di skad ces bya 'o
NEG: 3 — ba ma yin · pa med ces · na med pa'i
COMPOUND? ye shes sngon du 'gro = wisdom precedes (MITRA) · 'dun pa nyams pa med = to have undiminished desire or aspiration (MITRA) · yongs su rdzogs par bya = perfect, perfected, perfecting (MITRA) · de bzhin gshegs pa'i 'phrin = tathāgata activity, tathāgata activities (MITRA) · de bzhin gshegs pa = tathāgata, thus-gone, buddha (MITRA) · 'dun pas 'gro ba = desire anger (MITRA) · de bzhin gshegs pa'i = sarvatathagata guhya mahaguhya kosaksa yuanidhadi p… (RY) · sems can thams cad = all beings, all sentient, everyone (MITRA)
